# An ALLOWLIST, expressed the only way this file can express one: exclude
# everything, then name what ships.
#
# It was a denylist until 1.0.0, and a denylist only excludes what someone
# thought of. By then it was shipping the coverage HTML report, the pre-commit
# hook, `biome.jsonc`, `renovate.json`, `AGENTS.md` and
# `.git-blame-ignore-revs` into the Marketplace artifact — every one of them
# added to the repo AFTER the ignore file was last considered, and two of them
# describing internal tooling. It also still excluded `.husky/**`, which has not
# existed here for months.
#
# Seven lines is the whole extension: the manifest, the listing, the changelog
# (the Marketplace renders it as its own tab), the licence, the icon, and the
# two bundles. `vsce ls` is the check.
**
!package.json
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!LICENSE
!icon.png
!dist/extension.js
!dist/mcp-server.js
